        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>First off, I&#39;d like to say that I love this game, and I play it a LOT. &nbsp;However, there is one thing about the game that annoys me from time to time, and that&#39;s when you have an AE where order matters or you have to select X from a set of Y, or similar selections. &nbsp;Firstly, it&#39;s tedious, and secondly, on my tablet, the load time to pull back that bar of choices every time can really slow things down.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>As a result, what I would like is something where when you get a choice like this, have the normal &quot;bar&quot; with all the cards in it, and then just place an empty &quot;bar&quot; above it. &nbsp;Then you could just drag all the individual cards from the bottom bar to the top bar in an order of your choice, and then it would execute left-to-right through that bar. &nbsp;Obviously, it would still process all the individual pieces (increase/decrease for twist the ether, reactions on destroy, etc) for each target, but you would never have to return back to that target selection screen again.</p>",
