        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/{size}/1921_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-25T20:39:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It's been on our list to make improvements like that for a long time, but it's non-trivial. All sorts of things can happen that could cause your selections to become non-sensical, or cause you to change your mind, etc. In order to make sure things work properly in a non-surprising way, we've kept it sequential so far.</p>",
